{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextWrap\/plain(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/textwrap\/plain(_:)"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"plain","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"title":"plain(_:)","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Gnusto8TextWrapO5plainyS2SFZ","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Renders game text for a plain, non-reflowing channel: folds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paragraph’s soft breaks, then turns the hard-break marker into a real"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"newline."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"plain","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"text","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The game text to render."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text folded, with every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<br>"},{"type":"text","text":" replaced by a newline."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The fold runs "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"first"}]},{"text":". The other order would turn ","type":"text"},{"code":"<br>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into a newline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the fold then eats, silently downgrading a hard break to a space."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A paragraph therefore arrives as one line, however the author happened to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrap the literal. That is the whole point: a plain channel has no column"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to reflow to, so the alternative is printing at whatever width the source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was typed at — and printing at "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" widths the moment a clause is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interpolated onto a wrapped literal. The terminal the output lands in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wraps a long line; it cannot un-wrap a short one."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextWrap"]]},"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An engine for writing interactive fiction in Swift."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","kind":"symbol","title":"Gnusto","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TextWrap/plain(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","k